{{Documentation/Header}}
Renders one album row for [[List of Collaboration Albums]].

'''This template is never called by hand.''' It is a row formatter for a [[mw:Extension:Bucket|Bucket]] query: the list page runs <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:Bucket|get}}</nowiki></code> against the <code>collab_albums</code> table and passes each result row to this template via <code>format = template</code>. Its parameters are supplied by the query's <code>select</code> aliases, not by an editor.

It also emits raw table-row markup (it begins with <code>|-</code>), so it only works inside an open wikitable.

== How the data gets there ==
The pair works as a Bucket write/read cycle:
* {{T|CA}} sits on an album label page and '''writes''' a row into <code>collab_albums</code> via <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:Bucket|put}}</nowiki></code>.
* {{T|CA-row}} '''reads''' those rows back on [[List of Collaboration Albums]] and formats each one.

So adding an album means editing the label page with {{T|CA}} — never this template, and never the list page.

== Usage ==
The list page opens a wikitable, runs the query, then closes it:
<pre>
{| class="wikitable dataTable"
! Name/Content !! Release !! Label/Producer
{{#invoke:Bucket|get
|collab_albums
|select = album_name as name, album_display as display, page_name as label, release_text as release, release_date as date, cover_image as image
|where = year < 2011
|group by = image, date
|order by = date ASC
|limit = 1000
|format = template
|template = CA-row
}}
|}
</pre>

The <code>select</code> aliases must match the parameter names below — renaming an alias silently breaks the corresponding cell.

== Parameters ==
{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Bucket column !! Description !! Default
|-
| <code>name</code> || <code>album_name</code> || Album name. Used as the anchor target in the label-page link. || –
|-
| <code>display</code> || <code>album_display</code> || Text shown for the album. Falls back to <code>name</code>. || <code>name</code>
|-
| <code>label</code> || <code>page_name</code> || The label page the album belongs to. Empty or <code>N/A</code> renders as "Misc. Albums". || Misc. Albums
|-
| <code>date</code> || <code>release_date</code> || Normalized release date, displayed as <code>Y.m.d</code>. '''Takes precedence over <code>release</code>.''' || –
|-
| <code>release</code> || <code>release_text</code> || Raw release text. Shown only when <code>date</code> is empty. || –
|-
| <code>image</code> || <code>cover_image</code> || Cover image filename, shown at 100&nbsp;px. || Template doc.png
|}

== Output ==
Each call renders three cells:
# '''Name/Content''' — hidden sort key, cover image, and a link to <code><nowiki>[[label#name|display]]</nowiki></code>
# '''Release''' — an {{T|anchor}} plus the bolded date
# '''Label/Producer''' — a link to the label page

